    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、【2024 重庆邮电大学 3】某系统的全响应 $y(t)$ 与激励 $f(t)$ 以及初始状态 $x(0)$ 的关系表达式为",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            131,
            811,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny (t) = e ^ {- t} \\cdot x (0) + \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} \\sin (\\tau) f (\\tau) d \\tau\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            182,
            645,
            201
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "判断该系统是否为线性系统？\n\n解：完全向应 $y(t)$ 具有可分解性， $y_{i}(t)=e^{-t}x(0)$ ， $y_{s}(t)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}\\sin(\\tau)f(\\tau)d\\tau$ (1) $y_{i}(t)$ 线化判断：让初始状态乘 $e^{-t}$",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            209,
            927,
            306
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n[ a _ {1} x _ {1 0}) + a _ {2} x _ {2 0}) ] = e ^ {- t} [ a _ {1} x _ {1 0}) + a _ {2} x _ {2 0}) ]\\tag{①}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            282,
            302,
            707,
            349
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\na _ {1} y _ {2 i _ {1}} (t) + a _ {2} y _ {2 i _ {2}} (t) = a _ {1} e ^ {- t} x _ {1} (0) + a _ {2} e ^ {- t} x _ {2} (0)\\tag{2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            285,
            350,
            739,
            389
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①=② 故y比对初始状态呈线性关系",
        "bbox": [
            240,
            388,
            695,
            428
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $y_{x}(t)$ 线性判断：让激励 t→t，求 $\\sin(\\tau)$ 后填加 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{t} d\\tau$ 和 $H[a_{1}f_{1}(t)+a_{2}f_{2}(t)]=\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}\\sin(\\tau)\\left[a_{1}f_{1}(t)+a_{2}f_{2}(t)\\right]d\\tau$ ③ $a_{1}y_{x_{1}}(t)+a_{2}y_{x_{2}}(t)=a_{1}\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}\\sin(\\tau)f_{1}(t)d\\tau+a_{2}\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}\\sin(\\tau)f_{2}(t)d\\tau$ ④\n\n③ = ④ 故 $y_{x}(t)$ 与激励呈线性关系\n\n综上所述，该系统为线性系统。",
        "bbox": [
            188,
            435,
            890,
            667
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
