    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、【2024 华侨大学 3.1】设系统的初始状态为 $x(0)$ , 输入为 $f(t)$ , 完全响应为 $y(t)$ , 试判断下系统的性质（线性/非线性, 时变/时不变, 因果/非因果, 稳定/不稳定）;",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            808,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny (t) = 5 x (0) + f (2 t) + f (t + 3)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            368,
            181,
            626,
            198
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $y_{i1}$ 具有可分辨性, 其中 $y_{21}|t|=5x(10)$ , $y_{25}|t=f(2t)+f(1t+3)$ $H[a_1x_1(10)+a_2x_2(10)]=5[a_1x_1(10)+a_2x_2(10)] ①$ $a_1y_{2i1}(t)+a_2y_{2i2}(t)=a_15x_1(10)+a_25x_2(10) ②$ $H[a_1f(1t)+a_2f_2(1t)]=\\left[a_1f_1(2t)+a_2f_2(2t)\\right]+\\left[a_1f_1(1t+3)+a_2f_2(1t+3)\\right] ③$ $a_1y_{2s1}(t)+a_2y_{2s2}(t)=a_1[f_1(2t)+f_1(1t+3)]+a_2[f_2(2t)+f_2(1t+3)] ④$ ①=②, ③=④ 故系统为线性系统:",
        "bbox": [
            87,
            195,
            833,
            385
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "12) $H[f(t-t_{0})] = f(2t-t_{0}) + f(t+3-t_{0})$ ⑤ $y[t-t_{0}] = f(2(t-t_{0}) + f(t-t_{0}+3))$ ⑥\n\n⑧ ⑨ ⑩ 系元为时度系统.",
        "bbox": [
            97,
            385,
            831,
            469
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) $y_{x}(t) = f(2t) + f(t+3)$ 令 t=1 即 $y_{x}(1) = f(2) + f(4)$ 可见存在响应超前波动. 故非因果系统",
        "bbox": [
            97,
            480,
            902,
            555
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(6) $\\frac{1}{0}|f(t)|\\leq M$ 则 $|y_{x}(t)|=|f(x)+f(t+3)|\\leq|f(x)|+(|f(t+3)|\\leq M+M=2M$ 说明系统为稳定系统.",
        "bbox": [
            99,
