    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、【2024 电子科技大学 3】某二阶连续因果线性时不变系统，初始条件为 $y(0^{-}), y'(0^{-})$ ，已知：",
        "bbox": [
            178,
            106,
            810,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(a) 当 $y(0^{-}) = 2, y' (0^{-}) = 0, y_{zi1}(t) = (4e^{-t} - 2e^{-2t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            161,
            655,
            181
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(b) 当 $y(0^{-}) = 0, y' (0^{-}) = 1, y_{zi2}(t) = (e^{-t} - e^{-2t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            188,
            635,
            209
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(c) 当输入 $x_{1}(t), y(0^{-}) = 1, y^{\\prime}(0^{-}) = -1$ , 全响应 $y(t) = (1 + e^{-2t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            217,
            751,
            235
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求: $x_{2}(t) = 3x_{1}(t)$ 时, $y(0^{-}) = 2, y^{\\prime}(0^{-}) = -2$ , 全响应 $y_{2}(t)$ 在 $t > 0$ 时的表达式",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            245,
            801,
            264
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}(a)-(b) \\Rightarrow y_{1}(a^{-})=1, y_{1}(a^{-})=-1, \\text{对} \\frac{1}{2}y_{2i1}(a- y_{2i2}(a))=e^{-t}u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            258,
            929,
            317
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由(0)可知： $x_{1}(t)$ 对应要状态响应为 $y(t)-e^{-t}u(t)=\\left(1+e^{-2t}-e^{-t}\\right)(u(t))$",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            323,
            926,
            365
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 $x_{2}(t)=3x_{1}(t)$ 时 $y(0-2)=2$ ， $y'(0-2)=-2$ 时",
        "bbox": [
            196,
            375,
            643,
            412
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y _ {2 | t |}} & {= 3 (1 + e ^ {- x t} - e ^ {- t}) u (t) + 2 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {= (3 + 3 e ^ {- x t} - e ^ {- t}) u (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            151,
            423,
            606,
            524
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
