    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5、【2024 天津工业大学 27】某LTI系统, 系统起始状态为 $y(0_{-})$ , 已知: 当 $y(0_{-}) = 1$ , 激励为因果信号 $f(t)$ 时, 全响应 $y_{1}(t) = (e^{-t} + \\cos \\pi t) z(t)$ ; 当 $y(0_{-}) = 2$ , 激励为因果信号 $3f(t)$ 时, 全响应 $y_{2}(t) = 2\\cos \\pi t z(t)$ , 利用时域分析方法求 $y(0_{-}) = -2$ ,",
        "bbox": [
            176,
            106,
            816,
            179
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "激励为因果信号 $3f'(t) + f(t-1)$ 时，全响应 $y_{3}(t)$ 。\n\n解：令 $y_{(0,-1)} = 1$ ，鼓励 f(t) 分别对应的差输入和差状态为 $y_{2i}(t)$ 和 $y_{2k}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            179,
            185,
            902,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{则} y _ {1} (t) = y _ {x} (t) + y _ {x} (t). = [ e ^ {- t} + \\cos (\\pi t) ] u (t) ①\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            226,
            239,
            778,
            292
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 ${y}_{2}\\left( t\\right)  = 2{y}_{2} : \\left( t\\right)  + 3{y}_{x}\\left( t\\right)  = {20\\cos \\pi } + \\operatorname{arct}$",
        "bbox": [
            220,
            298,
            670,
            334
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "① ②联立可知: $y_{x|t|} = -2e^{-t}u(t)$ $y_{2i|t|} = (3e^{-t} + \\cos\\pi t)u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            342,
            678,
            413
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{故} y _ {3} (t)} & {= - 2 y _ {1} (t) + 3 y _ {2} (t) + y _ {2} (t - 1)} \\\\ & {= (- 6 e ^ {- t} - 2 \\cos \\pi t) u (t) - 6 [ - e ^ {- t} u (t) + d (t) ] - 2 e ^ {- (t - 1)} u (t - 1)} \\\\ & {= - 2 \\cos \\pi t (u (t)) - 6 d (t) - 2 e ^ {- (t - 1)} u (t - 1)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            225,
            448,
            919,
            590
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "4",
        "bbox": [
            936,
            967,
            952,
            980
        ],
