    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【2024 广东工业大学 3.3】描述某 LTI 系统的微分方程为 $y''(t) + 4y'(t) + 4y(t) = f'(t) + 3f(t)$ ，已知 $x(t) = e^{-t}u(t)$ ， $y(0_{+}) = 1$ ， $y'(0_{+}) = 3$ ，系统的零输入响应 $y_{zi}(t)$ 和零状态响应 $y_{zs}(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            106,
            813,
            176
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\alpha^ {2} + 4 \\alpha + 4 = (\\alpha + 2) ^ {2} = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            200,
            182,
            440,
            216
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{故} y _ {x} (t) = (A _ {1} t + A _ {2}) e ^ {- 2 t} + 2 e ^ {- t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            605,
            173,
            892,
            217
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\alpha_ {1, 2} = - 2 (= \\mathrm{重根})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            223,
            214,
            425,
            247
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {3} ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a 0 (t + 1) + b \\Delta (u t) \\Rightarrow a = 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            636,
            219,
            909,
            252
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {f (t) + 3 f (t)} & {= [ e ^ {- t} u (t) ] ^ {\\prime} + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {= - e ^ {- t} u (t) + \\sqrt {(t)} + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {= 2 e ^ {- t} u (t) + \\sqrt {(t)} \\mathrm{触项}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            189,
            256,
            568,
            365
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {x} ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\Delta (1 + t) \\Rightarrow y _ {x} ^ {\\prime} (a +) = a = 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            640,
            250,
            919,
            287
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {x} (t) = a t \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y _ {x} (a t) = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            631,
            283,
            902,
            321
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$t > 0$ 自由项 $= 2{e}^{-t}$ ,故 ${y}_{p}\\left( t\\right)  = B{e}^{-t}$",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            359,
            571,
            400
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} y _ {x 1} (x +) = A _ {2} + 2 = 0 \\\\ y _ {x 1} ^ {\\prime} (x +) = A _ {1} - 2 A _ {2} - 2 = 1 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            631,
            325,
            852,
            393
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
